          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "unpack",
          "expression": "distance = f16tof32(code & 0x7FFF); bUseRadianceCache = (code >> 15) != 0",
          "requires": [
            "RayTraceDistance"
          ],
          "sourceRefs": [
            "part2.refl.raydist.unpack"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "mathTerms": [
        "Stored as R16_UINT (not R16F) because bit 15 carries the flag; the low 15 bits are an IEEE half bit pattern.",
        "GetMaxHitDistance() = MaxHalfFloat = 65504, so the f16 clamp is lossless for legal trace distances."
      ],
      "producerSources": [
